WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:05.580
Lady Toki. I received news
of Lord Oden's demise.

3
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.800
They say he died a heroic death.

4
00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:22.740
[ODEN]
Toki, I see the end coming.

5
00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:24.620
If I fail to defeat Kaido"...

6
00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:27.240
[ODEN]
If I fail to defeat Kaido,

7
00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.450
it will be a long time
before a challenger

8
00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.330
as strong as I appears.

9
00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:32.220
And if hope does arrive,
it will come in 20 years.

10
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:35.140
"If hope arrives,
it will come in 20 years.

11
00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:38.260
I believe a massive war
will erupt,

12
00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:41.420
frightful enough
to split the seas.

13
00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.260
[ODEN]
In the midst of that conflict,

14
00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:44.490
powerful figures will fight
their way into the New World,

15
00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:46.660
Powerful figures will begin
to fight their way

16
00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:48.390
into the New World, riding the
waves of freedom.

17
00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:50.850
riding the waves of freedom.

18
00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:51.170
They will be the ones
to defeat Kaido!

19
00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:53.380
[ODEN]
...they will
be the ones to do it.

20
00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:54.900
[ODEN]
A long winter is
coming to the Land of Wano.

21
00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:58.240
A long winter is coming
to the Land of Wano.

22
00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:58.320
Toki.

23
00:00:58.320 --> 00:00:59.870
Toki, if I am to die
in this struggle,

24
00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:02.820
If I am to die in this struggle,
I want you to use your power.

25
00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:06.030
I want you to use your power.

26
00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:16.250
Take these home.

27
00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:19.040
Enma and Ame-no-Habakiri.

28
00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.340
I want our children
to inherit them.

29
00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:23.010
The children are a bit young.

30
00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:25.550
Not to mention small
to be swinging a sword.

31
00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:27.670
[gasps]
I was sentenced
to death, y'know!

32
00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:29.130
Why so nonchalant?

33
00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.640
You won't die. Not my husband.

34
00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:40.520
[laughs]
That's my wife!

35
00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:46.110
I'd be a laughingstock
if anyone saw me crying now.

36
00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:47.740
I'm a Kozuki as well.

37
00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:50.030
I will not be your weakness.

38
00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:53.410
Let us look to
the future together.

39
00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:56.290
Twenty years from now,
we'll win!

40
00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:36.110
<b>The Kozuki Clan</b>

41
00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:39.540
[ODEN]
Up you go!

42
00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:42.420
That's way too high!
Oden, stop! Please!

43
00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:44.460
[ODEN]
This is how wide the world is.

44
00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:47.760
Even from high in the sky,
you cannot see it all.

45
00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.890
Quite the miracle, is it not?

46
00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:52.680
Take a good look at
all the things

47
00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:56.100
you cannot find
in the Land of Wano.

48
00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:59.650
[gasps]
It's so shiny!

49
00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:01.690
Like treasure,
sparkling in the sea!

50
00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:05.440
Treasure, you say?
Seems you and I think alike!

51
00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:07.860
You take after
your father already!

52
00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:10.740
I shall teach you
all I know, Momonosuke.

53
00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:12.830
You must broaden your knowledge.

54
00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:16.000
Broaden your horizons!

55
00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:19.880
So tell me, my boy,
what kind of women do you like?

56
00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:21.380
[RAYLEIGH]
He's too young!

57
00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:22.800
[Momonosuke grunts]

58
00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:25.090
When you cut a man down,
think of him as a fishcake.

59
00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:26.300
Understand?

60
00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.760
[RAYLEIGH]
He's way too young!

61
00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:30.550
[laughs]

62
00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:36.060
[shamisen playing]

63
00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:36.170
[ODEN]
Ah, that's beautiful, Hiyori!

64
00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:38.730
[Oden]
Ah! That's beautiful, Hiyori!

65
00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:38.800
You've gotten so good
at playing!

66
00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.810
You've gotten so
good at playing!

67
00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:40.920
Really? The song's
called Moon Princess!

68
00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:41.930
[Hiyori]
Really?

69
00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:44.180
The song's called
"Moon Princess"!

70
00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:47.990
[Oden chuckles]

71
00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:50.240
I'm gonna try to
get even better!

72
00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:51.600
[Oden giggles]
Good! Keep it up!

73
00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:51.840
You can play it at
my funeral someday!

74
00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:52.700
Good! Keep it up!

75
00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:55.660
You can play it at
my funeral someday!

76
00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:59.920
[Hiyori crying]

77
00:04:57.370 --> 00:05:01.500
[crying]

78
00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.800
Hey, Momo! Stop making
your sister cry!

79
00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:06.630
You're the one who made her cry!

80
00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:06.860
Me? The funeral thing?

81
00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:09.760
Me? The funeral thing?
I'm sorry! It was only a joke!

82
00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:12.510
I'm sorry! It was only a joke!

83
00:05:12.780 --> 00:05:14.530
[Oden laughs]

84
00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:16.570
[gasps]
Promise?

85
00:05:16.570 --> 00:05:17.000
[Oden laughs]
Like I'd die and leave you!

86
00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.540
Like I'd die and leave you.

87
00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:22.720
Well, my lord?
How was the outside world?

88
00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:28.270
[gasps]
Its splendors are
difficult to express with words.

89
00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:26.570
[Subordinate D groans]

90
00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:27.690
[gasps]

91
00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:31.270
But every day was
a grand adventure!

92
00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:33.100
Did you-gara happen to see Zou?

93
00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:35.860
Yes! Wouldn't dare miss it!

94
00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:39.070
After all, the people of Zou
and the Kozuki Clan

95
00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:41.990
have held a strong bond
for many, many years.

96
00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:43.990
I was impressed by
the strength and loyalty

97
00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.200
of the Minks that I met there!

98
00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:49.120
If you're in a pinch,
Zou is the place to go!

99
00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:52.290
I'm sure you can count on them
to lend a helping paw!

100
00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.460
What do you mean "in a pinch"?

101
00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:57.250
[ODEN]
A pinch is a pinch!
You'll know!

102
00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:00.420
I'm sure I can count on you two
to save the day as well!

103
00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.380
Now I'm starting to blush!

104
00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:04.510
Better make sure
we don't disappoint.

105
00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:07.390
Right, Cat?

106
00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:08.140
[All gasp]

107
00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:11.880
I've come to help.
Be at ease, friends.

108
00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:14.510
[SHINOBU]
I've collected
your weapons for you.

109
00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:15.970
We are saved!

110
00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:18.010
[SHINOBU]
You all must survive.

111
00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:20.680
This country's future
depends on you.

112
00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:23.270
[KIN'EMON]
Well, we shall certainly try.

113
00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:24.890
You have my thanks.

114
00:06:24.890 --> 00:06:27.310
But of course. This is nothing.

115
00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:30.110
Oden Castle! That's our goal!

116
00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:31.320
To Kuri!

117
00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.230
[ALL]
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

118
00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:44.620
Sir Kin, one brief question.

119
00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:48.420
Could I be one of the Kozuki
Clan's retainers as well?

120
00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.750
We all forced ourselves into
the position, quite honestly.

121
00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:54.420
So the choice is up to you.

122
00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:56.180
Right.

123
00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:04.220
Huh? Look, here they are!
The samurai!

124
00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:08.270
[BEAST PIRATE C]
Gun 'em down, every last one!

125
00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:09.350
Kiku!

126
00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:10.480
Ready.

127
00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:24.610
– We're not done!
– [DOGSTORM] What?

128
00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:26.740
[Cat Viper grunts]

129
00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:29.540
Why don't you-gara
want me to fight the enemy?

130
00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:33.660
Perhaps you-gara are a spy!
Kaido said he might have one!

131
00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:38.800
Nonsense! You-gara taunted Kaido
and brought this upon us!

132
00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:42.090
Lord Oden might still be alive
if not for your arrogance!

133
00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:45.220
That's a damn lie!

134
00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:49.430
We're going to Zou
with or without you!

135
00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:51.310
They'll die before
they get there.

136
00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:58.770
[Both gasp]

137
00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:03.440
Stop that at once! Both of you!
Now is not the time!

138
00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:06.020
Dogstorm! Cat Viper!

139
00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:09.860
Damn it! What now?

140
00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:11.780
[growls]

141
00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:13.240
What is that thing?

142
00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:16.180
[KIN'EMON]
I fear we cannot
aid them! We must escape!

143
00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.060
[DENJIRO]
There are too many of them.

144
00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.390
Let's thin them out! You ready?

145
00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:21.980
Of course!

146
00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:35.220
I'll go and back them up!

147
00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:36.890
Run away!

148
00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:38.060
[gasps]

149
00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:57.290
Don't worry. I'll make certain
both of you escape,

150
00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.130
just hold on!

151
00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:01.300
I know what to do.

152
00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:15.370
[gasps]

153
00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:18.790
Mother, no!

154
00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:20.170
[HIYORI]
Mother!

155
00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:25.930
[Hiyori cries]

156
00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:27.470
[gasps]

157
00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:34.770
Mother, wake up!
Please, wake up!

158
00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:38.980
[KAIDO]
What's your name?

159
00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:40.400
[gasps]

160
00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:45.130
[cries]
It's too high!
I'm scared!

161
00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:48.280
[MOMONOSUKE]
Someone. Help.

162
00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:52.370
Someone help me!
I don't wanna die!

163
00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:57.060
[KAIDO]
Your father
was a fool of a lord.

164
00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:02.380
[KAIDO]
Your death will mark
the end of the Kozuki Clan.

165
00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:05.470
You're wrong!

166
00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:08.220
Your father's
a great man, Momonosuke.

167
00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:10.050
And one day...

168
00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:10.940
My father was...
he was a great samurai!

169
00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:15.110
My father was...
He was a great samurai!

170
00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:17.310
And one day...

171
00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:19.360
...the Kozuki Clan shall
rule this country once more.

172
00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:22.270
The Kozuki Clan shall rule
this country once more.

173
00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:25.460
And I will be the shogun!

174
00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:34.580
[whimpering]

175
00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:37.290
[KAIDO]
Shallow words,
and likely not your own.

176
00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.540
A dream stuffed in your head.

177
00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:42.350
I didn't know that
you were so young.

178
00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:45.900
[cries]
Father!

179
00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:48.520
Somebody, help!

180
00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:54.070
[Momonosuke crying]

181
00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:58.660
[Kaido sighs]
I've lost interest.

182
00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:11.380
[KAIDO]
To think that's Oden's son.

183
00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:15.220
Let him burn to ash,
along with the castle!

184
00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:21.810
[thud]

185
00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:23.060
[gasps]

186
00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:27.640
[KIN'EMON]
It is with heavy
heart I must relay this news.

187
00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:31.360
Despite our greatest efforts,
Lord Oden was slain.

188
00:11:29.590 --> 00:11:30.720
[thud]

189
00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:32.740
[TOKI]
Lift your heads.

190
00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:33.100
Let's leave. It's dangerous
here! There's no time!

191
00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:34.180
Let's leave.

192
00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:37.490
It's dangerous here!
There's no time!

193
00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:39.560
No, I shall remain behind.

194
00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:40.650
[all gasp] [All gasp]

195
00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:41.910
Reconsider!

196
00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:41.980
Please! It's not too late
to flee, Lady Toki!

197
00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:44.170
Please, it's not too late
to flee, Lady Toki!

198
00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:45.140
Lady Toki.

199
00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:45.000
[KIN'EMON]
I beg you.

200
00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:48.840
It is our honor to protect you
as long as we draw breath!

201
00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:50.630
[KIN'EMON]
I beg you!

202
00:11:50.630 --> 00:11:53.870
Leave to the future. Live on.

203
00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:56.880
[gasps]
The what?

204
00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.790
[Beast Pirates scream]

205
00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:09.630
[Beast Pirates gasp]

206
00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:10.920
Who was that?

207
00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:12.590
Shoot 'em down!

208
00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:20.430
[groans]

209
00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:25.520
[panting]

210
00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:29.520
Toki. I know why you came here
from 800 years ago.

211
00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:31.730
You wanted to
witness it for yourself.

212
00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:34.610
The whole world
turning upside down.

213
00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:35.570
Oden! You told me to jump
20 years into the future

214
00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:38.410
Then you should jump
20 years into the future!

215
00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:40.070
The day you seek...

216
00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:43.950
No dinner for you today.
What a pity.

217
00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.540
Aww! Well.

218
00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:47.800
That's only fair, since I'm
not making any money.

219
00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:49.050
Well, not anymore!

220
00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:50.220
That's not why!

221
00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:52.540
What?

222
00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:54.760
Then what? Just tell me!

223
00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:56.670
Because you said
something awful!

224
00:12:56.800 --> 00:13:00.760
<b>Bakura Town


Kuri</b>

225
00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:06.060
It's scary.
Like, something's wrong.

226
00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:08.020
What's this
bad feeling, Grandma?

227
00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:10.440
This is the end.

228
00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:13.200
We turned our back on Lord Oden.

229
00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:17.030
And now the gods have
turned their backs on us.

230
00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:23.910
[TOWNSPERSON C]
It is the
beginning of an endless night

231
00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:26.370
for all of Wano and its people.

232
00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:30.300
[Toki panting]

233
00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:35.300
[TOKI]
Oden. I came here because
I was running from the past.

234
00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:39.340
I always believed,
if I came to the future,

235
00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:41.470
there would be someone waiting.

236
00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:45.390
Someone who could
make a difference.

237
00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:50.230
[Townspeople gasping]

238
00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:52.070
It's Lady Toki.

239
00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:58.990
You are the moon,
yet unaware of the dawn.

240
00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:02.410
May your purpose be fulfilled.

241
00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:08.920
[Shutenmaru panting]

242
00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:08.330
[Toki panting]

243
00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:06.580
[Toki groans]

244
00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:07.670
[Townspeople gasp]

245
00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:09.460
[TOKI]
And cast nine shadows
on the night woven of 20 years!

246
00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:14.970
[TOKI]
And cast nine shadows
on the night woven of 20 years.

247
00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:19.150
And you shall know
the brilliance of the dawn!

248
00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:21.940
Remember this. Please!

249
00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:24.320
[gunshot]

250
00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:37.870
[Townspeople gasping]

251
00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.000
[TOKI]
Oden.

252
00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:54.980
Too cold! I wanted
this water boiling hot!

253
00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:58.280
It's as hot as it gets,
I can assure you!

254
00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:00.610
Don't you lie to me!

255
00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:04.200
It's freezing!
Freezing! Freezing!

256
00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:11.080
Look at my hand!
This water is scalding!

257
00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:13.750
You're going to cook yourself!

258
00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:17.300
[gasps]
I'm shivering cold!

259
00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:20.010
I can't stop shaking!

260
00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:22.220
I want the heads
of those samurai!

261
00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:23.510
I want their bones!

262
00:15:23.510 --> 00:15:25.680
What's taking so long?

263
00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:29.310
I can't rest
till I know they're dead!

264
00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:38.440
[Shutenmaru panting]

265
00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:45.650
Princess! Behold!

266
00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:46.800
Princess! Behold!
The Kappa Dance!

267
00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.320
The Kappa Dance! And...!

268
00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:51.660
And... Kappappa, kappappa!

269
00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:54.950
Kappappa and pa!

270
00:15:54.950 --> 00:16:00.460
[screams]

271
00:15:55.000 --> 00:16:01.040
[Denjiro screaming]

272
00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:05.550
[Denjiro grunts]

273
00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:39.410
[Both chuckle]

274
00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:41.830
[TOWNSPERSON D]
Hold it, pal!

275
00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:44.830
What's with those clothes?
A buncha filthy rags!

276
00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:48.210
I wonder. Do you really
live here in the capital?

277
00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:57.070
[Townspeople gasp]

278
00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:00.870
me!

279
00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:03.700
We're sorry!
You're strong as hell!

280
00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:05.040
Where did you come from?

281
00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:07.160
Let us work underneath you!

282
00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:09.540
What's your name, man?

283
00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:13.250
[BOTH]
Huh?

284
00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:17.840
[DENJIRO]
My name?

285
00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:22.260
[DENJIRO]
Well, let's see.

286
00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:24.600
"Kyoshiro" will do!

287
00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:23.940
<b>yoshiro Kyoshiro</b>

288
00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:27.110
<b>Kyoshiro</b>

289
00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:41.910
You're the Kyoshiro Family?

290
00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:43.450
Yes, sir!

291
00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:46.040
You may lift your head now.

292
00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.670
Your reputation is impeccable.

293
00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:54.720
What d'you say?
Want to serve as my guard?

294
00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:58.090
Why, that would be
an honor, my lord.

295
00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:01.530
[Orochi chuckles]
Very good. Very good!

296
00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:02.830
All is yours.

297
00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:05.370
Gold, women, guards.

298
00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:09.040
I shall gladly provide
everything that you may desire.

299
00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:13.460
[laughs]
Did you hear that?
I love this guy!

300
00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:15.520
[laughing]

301
00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:18.770
Where'd he come from?
Seems too good to be true.

302
00:18:18.770 --> 00:18:21.690
He's a wealthy businessman.
And he's strong?

303
00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:22.940
[TOWNSPERSON H]
He's a yakuza!

304
00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:26.440
He's taking
Boss Hyogoro's place!

305
00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:29.280
[TOWNSPERSON I]
The Kyoshiro
Family rules the Flower Capital!

306
00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:31.120
He has a weakness, though!

307
00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:33.240
Because he always
looks tired, right?

308
00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:36.040
That's why people call him
"Napping Kyoshiro"!

309
00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:37.830
Too much nightlife is my bet.

310
00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:39.920
[Denjiro chuckles]

311
00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:48.740
[TOWNSPERSON M]
It's Ushimitsu Kozo!

312
00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:53.510
[TOWNSPERSON N]
He stole money
from the storehouse again!

313
00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:59.160
<b>The Witching Hour Boy</b>

314
00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:03.060
[panting]

315
00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:05.320
[KAWAMATSU]
Princess! Lady Hiyori!

316
00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:09.400
Where did you go?
Please don't leave me!

317
00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:11.740
[gasps]

318
00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:15.300
Excuse me, Boss?

319
00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:19.220
[gasps]

320
00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:20.630
[TOWNSPERSON C]
We found this
cute little girl on the street.

321
00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:24.430
She acted like she was lost...
must be an orphan.

322
00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:29.220
[TOWNSPERSON C]
She's
practically starving to death.

323
00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:32.140
[gasps]

324
00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:35.640
What? Denjiro? Really?

325
00:19:35.640 --> 00:19:39.310
[DENJIRO]
None other. What a relief.

326
00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:41.600
It's been far too long.

327
00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:44.660
Denjiro.

328
00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:46.900
Gaze upon my face.

329
00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:50.780
Haunted by the ghost of wrath,
it's twisted into this shape.

330
00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:54.530
Even Kin'emon and the others
would not recognize me.

331
00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:57.280
And that is our strength!

332
00:19:57.280 --> 00:19:59.120
This shall be our secret,

333
00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:01.870
held till the day
of the final battle.

334
00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:04.380
Do not tell anyone about me.

335
00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:06.130
Even our allies.

336
00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:11.380
I shall protect you,
in Kawamatsu's stead.

337
00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:15.760
[DENJIRO]
And you shall bear
the name Komurasaki.

338
00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:20.810
[HIYORI]
This is for you, "Ushimitsu."

339
00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:23.310
They just can't stop
giving me money!

340
00:20:23.310 --> 00:20:25.270
[giggles]

341
00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:28.940
Don't be so reckless.
But thank you.

342
00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:32.570
I shall distribute it
in Ebisu Town.

343
00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:35.990
By the way. As I have
told you many times,

344
00:20:35.990 --> 00:20:40.200
you must always carry
fake blood under your kimono.

345
00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:42.910
Orochi is fixated on you.

346
00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:46.330
But he has no idea that
you're Lord Oden's daughter.

347
00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:48.000
I know it's difficult.

348
00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.840
But if something goes wrong,

349
00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:54.130
I will tear Orochi away from
Komurasaki with your death.

350
00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:55.970
It must be convincing enough

351
00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:59.430
that the entire capital
believes it.

352
00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:03.580
I've survived for
this long, haven't I?

353
00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:06.590
It's been nearly 20 years.

354
00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:08.220
The end is in sight.

355
00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:11.390
[NARRATOR]
Now, with the tale of
Kozuki Oden at its end,

356
00:21:11.390 --> 00:21:13.560
we arrive nearly at the present.

357
00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:15.810
A few months before
Luffy and Oden's allies

358
00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:20.090
<b>A Few
Months
Before
the Fire
Festival</b>

359
00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:18.350
come together for their
raid on Onigashima,

360
00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:21.270
Orochi receives a note.

361
00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:25.860
[Orochi gasps]
The ghosts!
I knew they were real!

362
00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:28.200
Now they're coming for me!

363
00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:33.080
[OROCHI]
So Toki really could
send people through time!

364
00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:36.700
Kin'emon. Kanjuro. Kikunojo.

365
00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:39.710
Momonosuke. And Raizo, too.

366
00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:40.980
Five of them!

367
00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:41.420
[OROCHI]
They came here from the
very day they should have died!

368
00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:45.630
They came here from the very
day they should have died!

369
00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:47.220
So those people
went missing 'cause

370
00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:49.180
they shot forward through time?

371
00:21:49.180 --> 00:21:51.390
Not 'cause they burned
with the castle?

372
00:21:51.390 --> 00:21:53.800
Someone's trying to
get under your skin.

373
00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:54.970
Don't let them.

374
00:21:54.970 --> 00:21:57.600
[OROCHI]
Look! Read it!
This isn't a joke!

375
00:21:57.600 --> 00:21:59.350
Here! Here!

376
00:22:09.780 --> 00:22:11.780
Keep a close eye on the coast!

377
00:22:11.780 --> 00:22:13.780
Someone will try to
leave the country!

378
00:22:13.780 --> 00:22:14.910
[BOTH]
Yessir!

379
00:22:14.910 --> 00:22:16.660
If what you're saying
turns out true,

380
00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:19.370
then I don't want you
to kill them.

381
00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:21.750
After 20 years,
there's something I want to

382
00:22:21.750 --> 00:22:24.960
ask the remnants
of the Kozuki Clan.

383
00:22:27.380 --> 00:22:30.800
[KAIDO]
So this report is
the work of your spy, I take it?

384
00:22:30.800 --> 00:22:32.340
Is he reliable?

385
00:22:32.340 --> 00:22:35.070
He is. Absolutely.

386
00:22:35.070 --> 00:22:38.640
To a frightful degree,
you might say.

387
00:22:42.310 --> 00:22:44.440
[OROCHI]
He was born
into a theater troupe,

388
00:22:44.440 --> 00:22:47.020
and raised upon the stage.

389
00:22:47.020 --> 00:22:50.690
But one day, thanks to the same
persecution that I suffered,

390
00:22:50.690 --> 00:22:54.200
his parents were killed in
the middle of a performance.

391
00:22:54.820 --> 00:22:56.370
[MAN A]
They said they're
from the same clan

392
00:22:56.370 --> 00:22:58.410
as the daimyo killer!

393
00:22:58.410 --> 00:22:59.660
[MAN B]
Serves them right!

394
00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:05.280
[OROCHI]
The only way he survived

395
00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:08.500
was by assuming different roles!

396
00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:11.950
<b>You're a descendant of the Kurozumi Clan's main family?!</b>

397
00:23:12.130 --> 00:23:15.300
That's right. It's a pity
your parents had to die,

398
00:23:15.300 --> 00:23:17.120
but I took revenge
on their killers.

399
00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:17.140
[cackles]
And we have so much
suffering yet to inflict!

400
00:23:17.140 --> 00:23:21.970
[laughs]
And do we have so much
suffering yet to inflict!

401
00:23:21.970 --> 00:23:25.460
Your new purpose is to live
your life among the Kozuki.

402
00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:25.480
In the end, you will die as
a member of the Kozuki Clan,

403
00:23:25.480 --> 00:23:28.230
In the end, you will die as
a member of the Kozuki Clan

404
00:23:28.230 --> 00:23:30.800
without anyone
knowing the truth.

405
00:23:33.030 --> 00:23:35.610
[OROCHI]
I'm offering you
a starring role!

406
00:23:35.610 --> 00:23:38.030
Here, on the stage of history.

407
00:23:38.030 --> 00:23:40.910
You're up for the job,
aren't you?

408
00:23:42.440 --> 00:23:45.650
<b>I've been looking for a place to die...</b>

409
00:23:47.030 --> 00:23:49.490
<b>It would be an honor.</b>

410
00:23:51.420 --> 00:23:54.010
A miserable creature,
whose only pleasure in life

411
00:23:54.010 --> 00:23:56.170
is to become someone else.

412
00:23:56.170 --> 00:23:59.300
[OROCHI]
Oh, and his
skills served me well.

413
00:23:59.300 --> 00:24:00.880
Whenever I borrowed
money from Oden,

414
00:24:00.880 --> 00:24:04.430
he always made sure
I got twice as much!

415
00:24:04.430 --> 00:24:08.350
If it wasn't for that money,
I couldn't have allied with you!

416
00:24:08.350 --> 00:24:10.850
And the information
he provided about Oden's raid

417
00:24:10.850 --> 00:24:13.850
was quite helpful as well!

418
00:24:13.850 --> 00:24:16.440
The man truly is insane.

419
00:24:16.440 --> 00:24:18.780
He was there
at Oden's execution.

420
00:24:18.780 --> 00:24:23.070
Ready to die with his enemies!

421
00:24:23.070 --> 00:24:25.660
[OROCHI]
He has no will of his own.

422
00:24:25.660 --> 00:24:26.950
So long as I tell him to,

423
00:24:26.950 --> 00:24:30.080
he'll play the part of
a loyal Kozuki retainer.

424
00:24:30.080 --> 00:24:34.120
Mindlessly sending me
information all the while.

425
00:24:34.120 --> 00:24:38.000
What a frightfully
loyal servant he is!

426
00:24:38.000 --> 00:24:43.010
[Townspeople chattering]

427
00:24:40.830 --> 00:24:43.210
<b>Flower

Capital



Present

Day</b>

428
00:24:50.380 --> 00:24:55.220
[NARRATOR]
The exploits of
Kozuki Oden have become legend.

429
00:24:58.220 --> 00:25:02.270
[NARRATOR]
Twenty years have
passed since his tragic demise.

430
00:25:02.270 --> 00:25:05.060
The remaining members
of the Kozuki Clan,

431
00:25:05.060 --> 00:25:07.230
the Kurozumi, and Kaido

432
00:25:07.230 --> 00:25:10.060
continue their struggle
in the present day.

433
00:25:10.060 --> 00:25:12.400
Oden's dream of opening
the borders lives on,

434
00:25:12.400 --> 00:25:14.610
thanks to Toki's final act.

435
00:25:14.610 --> 00:25:17.160
[gunshot]

436
00:25:19.910 --> 00:25:22.410
[NARRATOR]
His retainers
now take up their swords

437
00:25:22.410 --> 00:25:25.040
in a new era.

438
00:25:27.670 --> 00:25:30.500
[gasping]

439
00:25:27.870 --> 00:25:32.960
[All scream]

440
00:25:32.960 --> 00:25:35.380
[NARRATOR]
For months,
they risk their lives

441
00:25:35.380 --> 00:25:39.000
to recruit allies who would
join their struggle.

442
00:25:41.170 --> 00:25:43.260
[NARRATOR]
But their persistence pays off,

443
00:25:43.260 --> 00:25:46.300
and 4,200 people
stand at their side,

444
00:25:46.300 --> 00:25:48.550
determined to liberate
their country.

445
00:25:48.550 --> 00:25:50.330
The weapons and ships are ready.

446
00:25:50.330 --> 00:25:50.720
[NARRATOR]
The troops are gathered.

447
00:25:50.720 --> 00:25:52.250
The troops are gathered.

448
00:25:52.250 --> 00:25:52.580
At twilight on the day
of the Fire Festival,

449
00:25:52.580 --> 00:25:54.640
[KIN'EMON]
"Twilight on
the day of the Fire Festival,

450
00:25:54.640 --> 00:25:54.870
they prepare to depart
from Tokage Port.

451
00:25:54.870 --> 00:25:57.190
at Tokage Port"!

452
00:25:57.190 --> 00:26:00.090
Their destination? Onigashima!

453
00:26:00.090 --> 00:26:01.710
[LUFFY]
Kaido.

454
00:26:01.710 --> 00:26:04.420
[Orochi cackles]

455
00:26:04.420 --> 00:26:06.640
We'll kick your ass!

456
00:26:06.640 --> 00:26:12.220
[ALL]
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

457
00:26:12.220 --> 00:26:14.380
[NARRATOR]
But something has gone wrong.

458
00:26:14.380 --> 00:26:14.390
[MOMONOSUKE]
Stop this madness!
You can't take that boat!

459
00:26:14.390 --> 00:26:15.890
[MOMONOSUKE]
Stop this madness!

460
00:26:15.890 --> 00:26:17.550
You can't take that boat!

461
00:26:17.550 --> 00:26:20.140
All of you will die at sea!

462
00:26:20.580 --> 00:26:23.910
[KIN'EMON]
We cannot
throw away this opportunity.

463
00:26:23.910 --> 00:26:27.080
The chance you speak of
will not occur for another year.

464
00:26:27.080 --> 00:26:27.890
[gasps]

465
00:26:27.890 --> 00:26:30.100
Kaido will use
the full strength of his army

466
00:26:30.100 --> 00:26:30.250
to hunt down ever last
rebel in the country.

467
00:26:30.250 --> 00:26:33.620
to hunt down every last
rebel in the country.

468
00:26:35.560 --> 00:26:38.030
No, wait! Stop! No!

469
00:26:38.030 --> 00:26:40.610
Do not defy me! [sobs]

470
00:26:40.610 --> 00:26:44.570
Please! Kin'emon!
Ashura! Kanjuro!

471
00:26:51.460 --> 00:26:54.790
[NARRATOR]
Of the 4,200 troops
expected to arrive,

472
00:26:54.790 --> 00:26:56.840
not even one is present.

473
00:26:56.840 --> 00:27:00.590
There are signs of destruction
at the port, as well.

474
00:27:00.590 --> 00:27:02.470
The storm is raging.

475
00:27:02.470 --> 00:27:06.260
But the samurai push on.

476
00:27:06.260 --> 00:27:07.600
Come back!

477
00:27:07.600 --> 00:27:09.850
If you leave, you'll be
marching to your deaths!

478
00:27:09.850 --> 00:27:11.850
Be careful!

479
00:27:11.850 --> 00:27:16.480
Heed me, Lord Momonosuke!
We cannot falter here!

480
00:27:17.940 --> 00:27:19.820
[KIN'EMON]
Though, we may be few in number,

481
00:27:19.820 --> 00:27:22.860
that will allow us to sneak
into their midst undetected!

482
00:27:22.860 --> 00:27:27.240
Then I shall plunge
my sword into Kaido's neck!

483
00:27:27.950 --> 00:27:32.120
[KIN'EMON]
As long as we live,
we shall never relent!

484
00:27:34.240 --> 00:27:37.250
[Kaido cackles]

485
00:27:37.250 --> 00:27:39.830
[OKIKU]
How could it
have come to this?

486
00:27:40.180 --> 00:27:44.490
[OKIKU]
Does this not mean
our plan was leaked? Yet again?

487
00:27:44.490 --> 00:27:46.110
I considered that!

488
00:27:46.110 --> 00:27:50.720
In fact, I suspect that thought
has crossed all of our minds!

489
00:27:50.720 --> 00:27:54.680
It pains me to even
suggest this, but...

490
00:27:54.680 --> 00:27:55.010
[Kaido cackles]

491
00:27:55.010 --> 00:27:55.350
[KIN'EMON]
There may be
an enemy among us, even now!

492
00:27:55.350 --> 00:27:59.310
[KIN'EMON]
There may be an enemy
among us, even now!

493
00:28:01.810 --> 00:28:05.610
[KIN'EMON]
It is a truth
I don't even want to fathom.

494
00:28:05.610 --> 00:28:06.650
Master Kin!

495
00:28:06.650 --> 00:28:08.700
Where is the brave
warrior I know?

496
00:28:08.700 --> 00:28:10.030
You have one duty now!

497
00:28:10.030 --> 00:28:13.200
Find the traitor, cut them off,
and let them go!

498
00:28:13.200 --> 00:28:15.890
Otherwise, how can we proceed?

499
00:28:15.890 --> 00:28:18.850
[KIN'EMON]
But how can we find
them when they will not confess?

500
00:28:20.040 --> 00:28:20.690
[KANJURO]
I

501
00:28:22.700 --> 00:28:22.840
Kin! Let's put this
to rest, now!

502
00:28:22.840 --> 00:28:25.800
Kin, let's put this to rest now!

503
00:28:29.860 --> 00:28:32.940
For I was always the traitor!

504
00:28:32.940 --> 00:28:35.230
For I was always the traitor.

505
00:28:36.980 --> 00:28:41.240
What did you just say?

506
00:28:41.240 --> 00:28:44.570
No, it can't be!
You were in that pot!

507
00:28:44.570 --> 00:28:47.160
You nearly boiled to death
with the rest of us!

508
00:28:47.160 --> 00:28:50.330
[KANJURO]
Indeed, that would
have been a wonderful finale

509
00:28:50.330 --> 00:28:53.620
for a wonderful performance.

510
00:28:53.620 --> 00:28:55.840
I played one of
the Akazaya Nine.

511
00:28:55.840 --> 00:28:57.560
The Evening Shower Kanjuro,
Oden's loyal retainer.

512
00:28:57.560 --> 00:29:04.020
But he was but a character
upon a stage.

513
00:29:04.020 --> 00:29:07.230
[All yell]

514
00:29:16.270 --> 00:29:20.530
[KANJURO]
We shared our most
intimate joys and sorrows.

515
00:29:20.530 --> 00:29:22.360
I earned your trust.

516
00:29:22.360 --> 00:29:26.410
My intent was not to cause
you harm, nor did I resent you.

517
00:29:26.410 --> 00:29:30.160
I only used you to feed
information to Lord Orochi.

518
00:29:30.160 --> 00:29:33.160
Again and again.

519
00:29:33.160 --> 00:29:34.540
How can that be?

520
00:29:34.540 --> 00:29:36.750
You've lied to us
since the day we met?

521
00:29:36.750 --> 00:29:40.800
How could you do this?

522
00:29:37.450 --> 00:29:39.120
[Kanjuro chuckles]

523
00:29:39.120 --> 00:29:42.580
You never knew my real name.

524
00:29:42.580 --> 00:29:43.030
Kurozumi Kanjuro!

525
00:29:43.030 --> 00:29:45.370
[KANJURO]
Kurozumi Kanjuro!

526
00:29:45.370 --> 00:29:46.670
[Kanjuro chuckles]

527
00:29:45.370 --> 00:29:47.120
[grunts]

528
00:29:46.670 --> 00:29:47.120
Kanjuro!

529
00:29:47.120 --> 00:29:50.080
[KANJURO]
Need I say more?

530
00:29:51.160 --> 00:29:53.880
[KANJURO]
Remember when
the first plan was leaked?

531
00:29:53.880 --> 00:29:57.800
When you were all so sure
that Law's subordinates talked?

532
00:29:57.800 --> 00:29:58.990
[Kanjuro cackles]

533
00:29:58.990 --> 00:30:01.950
Though I must credit Yasuie
for his quick thinking,

534
00:30:01.950 --> 00:30:04.120
even if it cost him his life.

535
00:30:04.120 --> 00:30:07.680
Changing the meeting spot
was a brilliant strategy!

536
00:30:07.680 --> 00:30:11.020
[KANJURO]
But as soon as that
information made its way to me,

537
00:30:11.020 --> 00:30:14.730
his sacrifice
became meaningless!

538
00:30:18.230 --> 00:30:20.480
[KANJURO]
Then there was Zou,
an island that

539
00:30:20.480 --> 00:30:22.940
one cannot locate
without a Vivre Card.

540
00:30:22.940 --> 00:30:26.070
And yet Jack happened
upon it so easily!

541
00:30:26.070 --> 00:30:28.620
Didn't that strike you as odd?

542
00:30:29.480 --> 00:30:35.270
[All gasp]

543
00:30:35.270 --> 00:30:38.780
Why didn't you suspect
it was one of us?

544
00:30:42.020 --> 00:30:44.190
[KANJURO]
You searched
everywhere for answers,

545
00:30:44.190 --> 00:30:46.530
but you never looked
over your shoulder!

546
00:30:46.530 --> 00:30:48.400
You knew something was amiss!

547
00:30:48.400 --> 00:30:53.030
But you just couldn't
connect the dots!

548
00:30:57.750 --> 00:31:00.500
[Kanjuro chuckles]

549
00:31:00.500 --> 00:31:02.670
[BIRD GIFTER A]
Look!
It's just like Lord Orochi said!

550
00:31:13.870 --> 00:31:16.460
A tiny boat
headed to Onigashima!

551
00:31:16.460 --> 00:31:17.830
What a bunch of idiots!

552
00:31:17.830 --> 00:31:20.460
[BUTTERFLY GIFTER A chuckles]
Whatever will they do?

553
00:31:20.460 --> 00:31:21.840
I thought it was a joke!

554
00:31:21.840 --> 00:31:24.260
But they really are
the old Akazaya Samurai!

555
00:31:24.260 --> 00:31:27.640
But one of them's a spy
working for the shogun, huh?

556
00:31:27.640 --> 00:31:30.350
The one with
the big grin, I'd guess.

557
00:31:30.350 --> 00:31:31.930
None other!

558
00:31:33.930 --> 00:31:35.180
[gasps]

559
00:31:45.450 --> 00:31:48.660
[Kanjuro cackles]
Imagine if we'd died sooner!

560
00:31:48.660 --> 00:31:50.340
My secret would have sunk
to the bottom of the ocean!

561
00:31:50.340 --> 00:31:54.470
It would have been an honor
to play my role until the end!

562
00:31:55.540 --> 00:31:57.350
However, Lord Orochi stopped me.

563
00:31:57.350 --> 00:32:01.640
He said, "Well done.
The final act is finished."

564
00:32:01.640 --> 00:32:06.190
I'm to seize Momonosuke,
and take him to Onigashima!

565
00:32:02.400 --> 00:32:03.650
[Momonosuke groans]

566
00:32:06.230 --> 00:32:09.280
Kin'emon, help me!

567
00:32:09.280 --> 00:32:11.400
Unhand him, now!

568
00:32:11.400 --> 00:32:15.580
How did Kanjuro get to the port?

569
00:32:15.580 --> 00:32:17.200
Wait, no.

570
00:32:17.200 --> 00:32:21.000
If he's on the shore,
then this Kanjuro must be...

571
00:32:25.130 --> 00:32:28.460
But the Kanjuro we know has
never rendered in such detail!

572
00:32:28.460 --> 00:32:30.880
- [Kanjuro cackles]
- [Momonosuke cries]

573
00:32:32.400 --> 00:32:34.110
[Beast Pirates scream]

574
00:32:34.110 --> 00:32:38.950
[All gasp]

575
00:32:41.330 --> 00:32:43.710
[NAMI]
Seriously, you two?

576
00:32:43.710 --> 00:32:47.500
How are you dozing off
at a time like this? Get up!

577
00:32:47.500 --> 00:32:51.170
Huh? Are the repairs
wrapped up yet?

578
00:32:51.170 --> 00:32:54.220
[Beast Pirates scream]

579
00:32:51.210 --> 00:32:53.340
[Luffy sighs]

580
00:32:53.090 --> 00:32:54.800
[Luffy yells]

581
00:32:54.800 --> 00:32:55.800
[LUFFY]
Now that I had a nap,

582
00:32:55.800 --> 00:32:59.390
I just need dinner
so I can kick some ass!

583
00:33:00.310 --> 00:33:01.680
What's going on?

584
00:33:01.680 --> 00:33:04.390
[LUFFY]
Let 'er rip!

585
00:33:04.390 --> 00:33:06.690
[Beast Pirates scream]

586
00:33:06.690 --> 00:33:07.810
Sir Luffy?

587
00:33:07.810 --> 00:33:10.730
Hey, guys!
Sorry we're a little late!

588
00:33:10.730 --> 00:33:12.440
Who are they?

589
00:33:11.790 --> 00:33:13.870
[All gasp]

590
00:33:12.480 --> 00:33:14.530
[BEAST PIRATE D]
I thought that
we sank all the enemy ships!

591
00:33:14.530 --> 00:33:16.410
What happened?

592
00:33:17.700 --> 00:33:22.330
There's something
underneath the boat!

593
00:33:22.330 --> 00:33:25.040
[All gasp]

594
00:33:25.040 --> 00:33:25.430
[KIN'EMON]
Huh?

595
00:33:25.430 --> 00:33:27.720
Who the hell takes
a crappy little rowboat out

596
00:33:27.720 --> 00:33:29.930
in this kind of weather?

597
00:33:32.020 --> 00:33:32.250
Don't take the sea
lightly! Dumbasses!

598
00:33:32.250 --> 00:33:34.260
[Raizo gasps]
It's you!

599
00:33:35.630 --> 00:33:36.920
[Beast Pirates scream]

600
00:33:36.920 --> 00:33:39.020
Fire!

601
00:33:39.020 --> 00:33:40.280
[BEAST PIRATE A]
They're attacking from

602
00:33:40.280 --> 00:33:41.480
the other side now!

603
00:33:41.480 --> 00:33:43.280
Why did I see all those
ships and samurai

604
00:33:43.280 --> 00:33:45.780
hanging out at the port
like a bunch of idiots?

605
00:33:45.780 --> 00:33:46.990
What are they doing?

606
00:33:46.990 --> 00:33:49.580
What? Another ship?

607
00:33:51.950 --> 00:33:55.750
I almost sank them because
they were in my friggin' way!

608
00:33:59.610 --> 00:34:04.400
You're still alive!
And all your crewmates as well?!

609
00:34:04.400 --> 00:34:08.360
Didn't think you'd
bother to show, Jaggy!

610
00:34:08.360 --> 00:34:13.200
Go to hell! I am only here
to take Kaido's head!

611
00:34:18.580 --> 00:34:21.840
What's happening?
How are they here?

612
00:34:31.400 --> 00:34:34.280
How was I left
unaware of this plan?

613
00:34:34.280 --> 00:34:36.700
Luffy!

614
00:34:36.700 --> 00:34:40.000
[BEAST PIRATE A]
We weren't expecting this!

615
00:34:40.000 --> 00:34:41.830
They made it sound like
we were only dealing with

616
00:34:41.830 --> 00:34:44.960
a couple samurai in a rowboat!

617
00:34:44.960 --> 00:34:48.290
[BEAST PIRATE D]
I wasn't ready to fight pirates!

618
00:34:49.210 --> 00:34:50.840
[BIRD GIFTER A]
It's the Worst Generation!

619
00:34:50.840 --> 00:34:52.420
I thought they were locked up!

620
00:34:52.420 --> 00:34:54.470
Listen up, jerks!

621
00:34:54.470 --> 00:34:58.010
Stop messing with
the samurai's boat!

622
00:35:05.920 --> 00:35:09.160
The sea was made
for pirates like us!
